{"id":"d84df7f701355c56","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md","title":"VF严格强于KF","display":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — VF严格强于KF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","aliases":["91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","91-thm-VF-KF-equiv"],"display":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — VF严格强于KF","depends_on":["[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence</span><span>91-thm-VF-KF-equiv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — VF严格强于KF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-VF-KF-equivalence-—-VF-严格强于-KF\">thm-VF-KF-equivalence — VF 严格强于 KF</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (含全扩展语言归纳的标准 Kripke–Feferman 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (Cantini 的经典超赋值真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> (长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 的分层真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> (一个正算术归纳定义的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等价与严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所以</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>文件标签保留旧的“equivalence”字样以避免破坏入链，但正确结论是否定\n等强。KF 以强 Kleene 固定点为语义动机，其标准全归纳版本的算术强度\n相当于沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下迭代的分层真理；Cantini VF 以一致超赋值\n为语义动机，算术强度达到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>两种理论都采用经典的外部演绎逻辑，也都能刻画某些非经典语义现象，\n但这些相似性既不产生正公式上的一般双向可证性，也不产生保留证明的\n互译。比较理论强度必须比较明确版本的算术后果，不能由共享“固定点”\n或“真理谓词”直接推出等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence-—-VF-严格强于-KF","text":"thm-VF-KF-equivalence — VF 严格强于 KF","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}KF\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false}],"bytes":1891,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["669ee474b9646a38","a0a2284f96eaea1d","c87db4d1858a0009"]}